DESCRIPTION:The UNC Music Department is thrilled to present the 2026 Festiv
 al on the Hill: Speak\, Listen. This installment of the biannual festival 
 is about creating spaces for important musical voices to speak\, and to li
 sten in musical dialogue\, across time\, place\, and genre - Across variou
 s locations at Carolina.\n \n\nThe centerpiece of the festival is composer
  Gabriela Lena Frank’s Conquest Requiem (2017)\, featuring the UNC Symph
 ony Orchestra and Carolina Choir joined by two professional soloists (incl
 uding UNC Chapel Hill’s own LaToya Lain) in this large-scale work.\n \n\
 nThe festival will also feature research\, a soundwalk\, and several conce
 rts during the three-day event.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Festival on the Hill
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/festival-on-the-hill
