DESCRIPTION:This session provides an overview of recent changes to the Nati
 onal Institutes of Health (NIH) grant application requirements\, including
  new Common Forms that will be required for due dates on or after January 
 25\, 2026.\n\n \n\nIn particular\, this presentation will focus on the Bio
 sketch and Current and Pending (Other) Support forms\, which will need to 
 be completed using the SciENcv tool. It will include demonstrations of Sci
 ENcv as well as ORCID iD creation and linking steps. The presentation aims
  to prepare researchers for the new NIH requirements by providing detailed
  instructions and resources to ensure compliance. \n\n \n\nThis program is
  offered by the University Libraries Health Sciences Library and led by Ka
 therine Howell.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Overview of 2026 NIH Requirements: Biosketch and Current and Pendin
 g (Other) Support
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/overview-of-2026-nih-requireme
 nts-biosketch-and-current-and-pending-other-support-3697
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
