DESCRIPTION:Strengthening Engagement in Research: Building and Maintaining 
 Relationships with Patient & Community Partners\n\n \n\nMeaningful partner
 ships with patients\, community members\, or other collaborators involved 
 in your research are invaluable. Projects are set up for success when care
  is intentionally given to developing and strengthening partnerships over 
 time.\n\n \n\nThis online training will describe best practices for buildi
 ng mutually beneficial partnerships. The session will also cover common ch
 allenges that researchers and patient\, community\, and other partners exp
 erience when working together\, along with suggested solutions.\n\n \n\nPa
 rticipation in our Engagement in Research 101 or Engagement in Research Nu
 ts and Bolts trainings are not required to attend this session\; however\,
  some knowledge of engagement\, whether from prior training(s) or personal
  experience\, may foster deeper understanding of the material in this sess
 ion.\n\n \n\nPresenters:\nAlicia Bilheimer\, MPH - Director of Engaged Sci
 ence\, NC TraCS\nVeronica Carlisle\, MPH\, CHES - Senior Community Health 
 Educator\, UNC Lineberger Comprehensive Cancer Center (LCCC)\nNisha Datta\
 , MS - Senior Project Manager\, NC TraCS\nSimone Frank\, MPH - Senior Proj
 ect Manager\, NC TraCS\nJennifer Potter\, MPH\, CHES - Senior Program Coor
 dinator for Clinical Outreach\, LCCC\nMembers of the NC TraCS Community an
 d Patient Advisory Board and the UNC Lineberger Community Advisory Board\n
 \n \n\nRegister\n\n \n\nEngaging Patient\, Community\, and Other Partners 
 in Your Research is a multi-part online training series. You may register 
 for the entire series OR any single training session. This training series
  was developed collaboratively with patient\, community\, and researcher p
 artners and is co-sponsored by the UNC Lineberger Comprehensive Cancer Cen
 ter and NC TraCS Institute.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Strengthening Engagement in Research: Building and Maintaining Rela
 tionships with Patient & Community Partners
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/strengthening-engagement-in-re
 search-building-and-maintaining-relationships-with-patient-community-partn
 ers-6195
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
