DESCRIPTION:Join Morehead Planetarium and Science Center for April’s Teen
  Science Cafe!\n\n \n\nIn this interactive session\, Dr. Alper Bozkurt wil
 l share his firsthand experiences at the intersection of science and story
 telling. From consulting on Disney films to collaborating with creatives b
 ehind movies\, documentaries\, and games\, he has seen how science inspire
 s Hollywood and how Hollywood\, in turn\, inspires real scientific breakth
 roughs.\n\n \n\nOpen to teens ages 13-18\, Morehead's monthly cafes includ
 e exciting activities\, engaging talks from expert speakers\, and even fre
 e food! We cover a variety of different topics\, ranging from cell biology
  to deep space galaxies\, making it a unique spot for high school students
  to explore new ideas\, interact with each other\, and have fun!\n\n \n\nT
 here’s no need to RSVP. Just bring your friends!
