DESCRIPTION:Join Morehead Planetarium and Science Center for the last Teen 
 Science Cafe of the school year! In this session\, sociologist and informa
 tion scholar Dr. Francesca Tripodi will discuss the social impacts of AI.\
 n\n \n\nOpen to teens ages 13-18\, Morehead's monthly cafes include exciti
 ng activities\, engaging talks from expert speakers\, and even free food! 
 Covering a variety of different topics\, ranging from cell biology to deep
  space galaxies\, Teen Science Cafe is a unique spot for high school stude
 nts to explore new ideas\, interact with each other\, and have fun!\n\n \n
 \nThere’s no need to RSVP. Just bring your friends!
GEO:35.913753;-79.050409
LOCATION:Morehead Planetarium and Science Center
