 e our place in space.\n\n \n\nStar Families is a special series that provi
 des an immersive\, family-friendly planetarium experience. Arrive before y
 our show or stay after to journey through Morehead's interactive exhibits\
 , science demo spaces\, and Cosmic Goods gift shop.\n\n \n\nThis program i
 s recommended for families and children ages 7+.
