UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51375530213646
DTSTART:20260527T160000Z
DTEND:20260527T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:Stress can compromise healthy breathing habits\, but practicing
  breath work can reduce anxiety\, encourage sleep\, and in some cases\, lo
 wer blood pressure. Participants will experience a variety of quick\, easy
  breathing techniques during this course\, and share back their results.\n
 \n \n\nWorkshop Objectives\nParticipants in this training will:\n• Try a
  60-Second Breathing Meditation\n• Practice Box Breathing\n• Experienc
 e 4-7-8 Breathing\n• Review some other Intentional Breathing techniques\
 n\n \n\nClick on Carolina Talent registration link and select the “Reque
 st” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Breathing Techniques to Relieve Stress and Improve Health
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/breathing-techniques-to-reliev
 e-stress-and-improve-health-6116
CATEGORIES:Workshops and Classes
END:VEVENT
