 , faculty\, staff\, and community members come together over coffee to exp
 lore the fast-moving world of artificial intelligence. Whether you're deep
 ly involved in AI or simply curious about the latest ideas\, this is a wel
 coming space to share insights\, ask questions\, network\, and connect thr
 ough conversation about all things AI.\n\n \n\nCan't come in June? Join us
  for July's AI Unfiltered!
