DESCRIPTION:Organizations are investing in benefits to improve employee wel
 lbeing\, and taking on initiatives to foster a culture of wellbeing in the
  workplace. However\, many employees still feel that their job is an obsta
 cle to their wellbeing rather than a help. What can you do as a manager to
  shift that perception? This session will discuss practical ways to show e
 mployees that you and your organization support their wellbeing.\n\n \n\nW
 orkshop Objectives\nThis training will help you:\n• Describe ways in whi
 ch a manager can promote employee wellbeing\n• Become an advocate for we
 llbeing resources available to your employees\n• Have productive convers
 ations with employees to address concerns that work is negatively impactin
 g their wellbeing\n• Lead by example in demonstrating that you place a h
 igh priority on your own wellbeing\n\n \n\nClick on Carolina Talent regist
 ration link and select the “Request” button to automatically enroll.
LOCATION:
SUMMARY:Supporting Employee Well-Being: What can you do as a manager?
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.unc.edu/event/supporting-employee-well-being
 -what-can-you-do-as-a-manager-1734
